@* OmniTitleTooltips, placed once in a layout, replaces the browser's own tooltip of every title attribute
   with the package's: at most 12rem wide, with a tip towards the pointer. An icon-only button named by
   its title keeps that name for assistive technology while the tooltip is shown. *@
<OmniTitleTooltips />
<OmniButton Variant="OmniButtonVariant.Secondary" title="The package's tooltip on a plain title attribute.">
    <OmniIcon Name="OmniIconName.Info" />
    <span>Hover me</span>
</OmniButton>
